              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikindi, utoranye mu bantu bose abashoboye guca imanza, bubaha Imana, b’abanyakuri, banka ingurire; uheze ubakuze, babe bakuru bo kuganza abantu, bamwe igihumbi‐igihumbi, abandi ijana‐ijana, abandi mirongwitanu‐itanu, abandi cumi‐cumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
